{"id":"55612987d4585fa4","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md","title":"Arithmetical Interpretation","display":"df-arithmetical-interpretation — Arithmetical Interpretation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation","aliases":["89-df-arithmetical-interpretation"],"display":"df-arithmetical-interpretation — Arithmetical Interpretation","depends_on":["[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-realization-function]]","[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","[[88-df-numeral]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-arithmetical-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-interpretation — Arithmetical Interpretation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a50ebde4b7b3e426\" href=\"?note=a50ebde4b7b3e426\" title=\"89-df-realization-function\">89-df-realization-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-arithmetical-interpretation-—-Arithmetical-Interpretation-$$\">df-arithmetical-interpretation — Arithmetical Interpretation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*\">\\(*\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a recursively axiomatized arithmetical theory.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_T\">\\(\\bot_T\\)</span> is a fixed contradictory sentence of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (for PA, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S0\">\\(0=S0\\)</span>), not an assumption that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is consistent.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\">\\(r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\\)</span> (see\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a50ebde4b7b3e426\" href=\"?note=a50ebde4b7b3e426\" title=\"89-df-realization-function\">89-df-realization-function</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\\)</span> is the one-free-variable arithmetical\nprovability formula fixed in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}interpretation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_{T,r}&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Sent}_{T},\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot_T,\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq r(p),\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi)\\land\\tau_{T,r}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(\\Box\\varphi)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}\n\\bigl(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi)\\urcorner}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}interpretation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_{T,r}&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Sent}_{T},\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot_T,\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq r(p),\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi)\\land\\tau_{T,r}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(\\Box\\varphi)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}\n\\bigl(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi)\\urcorner}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{T,r}\">\\(\\tau_{T,r}\\)</span> : the unique structural extension of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>; the five\ndisplayed clauses range over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> : 可证性谓词 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi)\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi)\\urcorner\\)</span> 是元层 Gödel 数；加横线后得到\n可代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\\)</span> 的对象语言数词。</li>\n<li>将<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span>解释为&quot;可证&quot;；递归覆盖全部原始构造子。</li>\n<li>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 3 章，印刷页 51–52；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-arithmetical-interpretation-—-Arithmetical-Interpretation-$$","text":"df-arithmetical-interpretation — Arithmetical Interpretation $*$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-realization-function","status":"resolved","id":"a50ebde4b7b3e426","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-realization-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-realization-function","status":"resolved","id":"a50ebde4b7b3e426","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}$ (see\n[[89-df-realization-function]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)$ is the one-free-variable arithmetical\nprovability formula fixed in [[89-df-provability-predicate]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ : 可证性谓词 (see [[89-df-provability-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"*","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"0=S0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}interpretation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_{T,r}&:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Sent}_{T},\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(\\bot)&\\coloneqq\\bot_T,\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(p)&\\coloneqq r(p),\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(\\neg\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n&\\coloneqq\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi)\\land\\tau_{T,r}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\tau_{T,r}(\\Box\\varphi)\n&\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}\n\\bigl(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi)\\urcorner}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau_{T,r}","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\tau_{T,r}(\\varphi)\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false}],"bytes":2101,"backlinks":[{"id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"For each $r\\in\\mathcal R_T$, $\\tau_{T,r}$ is the structural\ntranslation from [[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]."},{"id":"0fcc108fa2ae7636","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\ \\urcorner$ 与 $\\overline n$ 是已有算术有限句法的 Gödel 编码与数词接口，see [[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]。"},{"id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\Box$ 是模态语言的原始一元构造子；其算术解释由 [[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]] 单独给出。"},{"id":"ea390338eae06fff","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal R_T$ and $\\tau_{T,r}$ are fixed by\n[[89-df-realization-function]] and\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]."},{"id":"19a5fceb5d504d9f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PL}(T)$ quantifies over every assignment of arithmetical sentences to\npropositional variables; the structural extension and the interpretation of\n$\\Box$ are supplied by [[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]."},{"id":"a50ebde4b7b3e426","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"The structural extension of $r$ is defined separately in [[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]."},{"id":"97b68cd750e79cac","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e5cb4b74acf0f7a9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]] → [[89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma]] → [[89-thm-